#: class/manage-maintenance.class.php:76
msgid "Taxonomy Cleanup"
msgstr "Osztályozás (taxonomy) tisztítása"

#: class/manage-maintenance.class.php:77
msgid ""
"Remove empty tags and categories to declutter filters. Posts will not be "
